<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 72px 20px 72px', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC","Noto Sans SC","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif' }} notes={`这张图是整条链路：写脚本、等你确认、合成、后期、打包，五段接力。

我想重点说的是图里没画出来的那个东西——状态机。一开始我会在各个函数里自己判断「现在到哪一步了、下一步能不能走」，后来发现这样一定会漏。现在只有一个地方定义状态转移，别的地方想跳步，直接拒绝。

这么改不是为了代码好看，是因为能救命。服务器一崩，卡在合成阶段的任务原本会永远停在那儿不动；现在启动的时候会扫一遍，凡是没走到终态的，要么拉回去重跑，要么明确判失败。

这一条我是踩了坑才补上的。大概在第十二天，我连续两次意外断掉服务，才发现有一批任务再也不会动了。`}>

    {/* A · 标题块 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>五段流水线，状态机说了算</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E7480', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>02 它凭什么能跑通</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6E7480', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                状态转移只在一个文件里定义，别处想跳步会被拒绝
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 10 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.12 }} />
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* B · 内容区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', paddingTop: 28, paddingBottom: 24 }}>

        {/* 左栏：流水线 */}
        <Box style={{ width: 640, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', paddingRight: 48 }}>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, background: '#D9480F', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace' }}>1</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B' }}>脚本生成</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6E7480' }}>DeepSeek 写 A / B 对话，逐行落库</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 2, height: 18, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.18, marginLeft: 15 }} />

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, background: '#15171B', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace' }}>2</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B' }}>等你确认</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6E7480' }}>脚本先给你看，能改、能退</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 2, height: 18, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.18, marginLeft: 15 }} />

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, background: '#15171B', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace' }}>3</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B' }}>合成</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6E7480' }}>CosyVoice 逐句念，算完一句存一句</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 2, height: 18, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.18, marginLeft: 15 }} />

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, background: '#15171B', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace' }}>4</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B' }}>后期</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6E7480' }}>停顿、拼接、响度归一、片头片尾</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 2, height: 18, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.18, marginLeft: 15 }} />

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, background: '#15171B', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace' }}>5</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B' }}>打包</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6E7480' }}>导出 mp3、写 RSS、进订阅源</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 20 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.12 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#6E7480', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                9 个状态：PENDING · SCRIPTING · SCRIPT_READY · SYNTHESIZING<br />POSTPROCESSING · PACKAGING · DONE · FAILED · CANCELED
            </Text>

        </Box>

        {/* 右栏：为什么 */}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                为什么非要这么做
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 14 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4B5158', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
                能不能从这一步跳到那一步，不是各处代码各写一套判断 —— 只有一张状态转移表说了算。代码想硬跳，会被直接拒绝。
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 18 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4B5158', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
                好处不是「优雅」，是断了能接上。服务一崩，卡在合成阶段的任务原本会永远停在那儿；现在启动时会扫一遍非终态任务，该拉回脚本阶段的重跑，该判失败的判失败。
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 20 }} />
            <Box style={{ borderLeft: '2px solid #D9480F', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#15171B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    这条是踩坑之后才补的 —— 补之前，一次意外断服务就留下一批不会动的任务。
                </Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    {/* C · 页脚条 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 18, height: 2, background: '#D9480F' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E7480', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>双人对话播客自动生成系统 · 项目答辩</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E7480', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>09 / 17</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
